    "result_text": "All 271 tests pass. The change is complete.\n\n## Summary\n\nImplemented automatic `registrationDate` defaulting for owner creation:\n\n1. **`openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added a read-only `registrationDate` field (`type: string, format: date`) to the `Owner` response schema. The OpenAPI generator produces a `LocalDate registrationDate` on `OwnerDto`, which Jackson serializes as ISO `YYYY-MM-DD`.\n\n2. **`Owner.java`** \u2014 Added a `registrationDate` (`LocalDate`) column (`registration_date`) with getter/setter, plus the `java.time.LocalDate` import.\n\n3. **`OwnerRestControllerV1.addOwner`** \u2014 When creating an owner without a registration date, it now sets `registrationDate` to `LocalDate.now()` before saving.\n\n4. **DB schemas** (hsqldb, h2, mysql, postgres) \u2014 Added the `registration_date DATE` column to the `owners` table.\n\nMapStruct auto-maps `registrationDate` between entity and DTO (matching names), so no mapper changes were needed. The new `Cp08Tests` acceptance test passes, and the full suite (271 tests) is green.",
